<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="<%= description %>">
  <meta property="og:title" content="<%= title %>">
  <meta property="og:description" content="<%= description %>">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/legal.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main id="main-content">
    <div class="page-intro">
      <div class="container container--tight">
        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-date">Last updated: September 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="legal-body">
      <div class="container container--tight">
        <article class="legal-content">

          <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>
          <p>Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work efficiently and to provide information to the site owners.</p>

          <h2>2. Cookies We Use</h2>
          <p>We use a minimal number of cookies, limited to what is necessary for the website to function and to respect your preferences.</p>

          <h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
          <table class="legal-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Cookie Name</th>
                <th>Purpose</th>
                <th>Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>cookie_consent</td>
                <td>Stores your cookie consent preference so we do not ask you again on every visit.</td>
                <td>365 days</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p>Essential cookies are necessary for the website to function. They cannot be disabled.</p>

          <h3>Analytics Cookies (Optional)</h3>
          <p>If you accept cookies through our consent banner, we may use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the website. These cookies collect anonymous, aggregated data only.</p>
          <table class="legal-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Cookie Name</th>
                <th>Purpose</th>
                <th>Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>_ga</td>
                <td>Google Analytics: distinguishes unique users</td>
                <td>2 years</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>_ga_*</td>
                <td>Google Analytics: maintains session state</td>
                <td>2 years</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p>Analytics cookies are only set if you click "Accept" on our cookie consent banner. If you click "Decline", no analytics cookies are set.</p>

          <h2>3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
          <p>Our website does not embed third-party content (such as social media widgets or video players) that would set additional cookies. Links to external services such as Google Maps or WhatsApp open in a new tab and are governed by those services' own cookie policies.</p>

          <h2>4. How to Manage Cookies</h2>
          <p>You can manage cookies through:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Our cookie consent banner</strong> Click "Decline" to reject non-essential cookies. Your preference is saved and the banner will not appear again.</li>
            <li><strong>Your browser settings</strong> Most browsers allow you to block or delete cookies. Refer to your browser's help documentation for instructions. Note that blocking essential cookies may affect website functionality.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To reset your cookie preference on our website, clear the <code>cookie_consent</code> item from your browser's local storage.</p>

          <h2>5. Updates to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Cookie Policy if we change the cookies we use. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

          <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>For questions about this Cookie Policy, contact us at:</p>
          <div class="legal-address">
            <p><strong>The Citadels</strong></p>
            <p>10 Sicily Street, off Makram Ebeid Street</p>
            <p>Nasr City, Cairo 11765, Egypt</p>
            <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+201069631049">+20 106 963 1049</a></p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@thecitadels.com">info@thecitadels.com</a></p>
          </div>

        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/cookie-consent') %>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
